# Whitelist for ops/docker/python.Dockerfile (context = repo root): only the two Python packages.
# Client material, local databases, virtualenvs and secrets can never enter the image.
*
!fscore
!fsweb
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/tests
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/var
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.fspkg
